# The generated Xcode project is NOT tracked: project.yml is
# the sole source of truth and `make gen` (pinned XcodeGen,
# version-asserted in the Makefile) reproduces it
# deterministically. Committing the pbxproj alongside a
# generator invites silent drift (Xcode-made edits wiped by the
# next regen), so only the YAML is reviewed. Fresh clones run
# `make gen` first — see README.
Hylete.xcodeproj/

